This page lists some useful [[Modding]] tutorials.

* [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cJ68vYqzSm0 How to Isaac Sprites by LeatherIceCream]
*: The Antibirth developer LeatherIceCream demonstrates how to create sprites in the style of The Binding of Isaac. Applies to all versions of the game.
* [https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLMZJyHSWa_My5DDoTQcKCgs475xIpQHSF The Modding of Isaac: Afterbirth+ with Lyte by Lytebringr]
*: A series of video tutorials by Lytebringr focused on Afterbirth+ exploring various modding topics such as XML and PNG modifications and Lua scripting.
* [https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLKQ0xZyS4-66IbMbHpCU1p7NNbj50h7ly How to mod Afterbirth+ by Eufuu]
*: A collection of video tutorials by Eufuu focused on Afterbirth+ that provides some basic knowledge on how to get started with modding.
* [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oIm8hhXgYlg Afterbirth+ Animation Editor Tutorial by OnyxDarkKnight]
*: A video tutorial by OnyxDarkKnight that shows how to use the Animation Editor that comes with The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth+.
* [https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLkIbky8_pFUpqAF9l7dh_YsEV-zpJ4q50 {{dlc|r}} Repentance Modding Tutorials by Catinsurance]
*: A series of video tutorials by Catinsurance focused on Repentance changes about modding.

